# #633: retry failed downloads from Maven Central. Read by every ./mvnw run (CI, the Docker build,
# local builds); these keys are Maven Resolver 2's, the resolver of the wrapper's Maven 3.10.
# Maven's defaults gave up on 429 after 3 retries (30 s) and failed 502/504 at once, which turned
# Central's rate limiting on shared CI runners into red builds.
# Up to 5 retries for a dropped connection or an HTTP status listed below. A status retry waits
# interval x attempt (10, 20, 30, 40, 50 s, 2.5 min in all), or the server's Retry-After.
-Daether.transport.http.retryHandler.count=5
-Daether.transport.http.retryHandler.interval=10000
-Daether.transport.http.retryHandler.serviceUnavailable=429,502,503,504
# A download that sends no data for 60 s fails (default: 30 min), so .mvn/resolve-dependencies.sh
# can retry it instead of waiting on a stalled connection.
-Daether.transport.http.requestTimeout=60000
